  <work>
    <work-title>加沃特回旋曲（完整乐章）/ Gavotte en Rondeau</work-title>
  </work>
  <identification>
    <creator type="composer">J. S. Bach · BWV 1006</creator>
    <rights>J. S. Bach, BWV 1006, complete Gavotte en Rondeau; Hajo Dezelski, Mutopia-2008/07/13-1471, Bach-Gesellschaft 1879 Band 27.1. Music Viewer performance edition: all 102 printed measures and both voices retained; source opening volta performed twice; empty engraving half-bar placeholders compressed. Six trills realized from the upper auxiliary as eight 32nds per quarter; one mordent realized as principal/lower/principal with the remaining principal held. Re-engraved beam grouping; original slurs, chords, and triplets retained; editorial quarter=110. CC BY-SA 3.0.</rights>
  </identification>
